h Instagram, WhatsApp, or email."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Technical information"}]," — basic device and browser information, and anonymous usage data that helps us keep the website running smoothly."]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"use","className":"scroll-mt-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-medium text-ink md:text-3xl","children":"3. How we use your information"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/90","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"We use the information we collect to:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-2 pl-5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Create and manage your account, bookings, and memberships."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Process payments and issue invoices and receipts."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Send you confirmations, reminders, and important notices about your classes and membership."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Respond to your enquiries, feedback, and review submissions."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Improve our classes, schedules, pricing, and the website itself."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Meet our legal, accounting, and regulatory obligations in India."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We do not sell your personal information to anyone, ever. We do not use your information to profile you for third-party advertising."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"sharing","className":"scroll-mt-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-medium text-ink md:text-3xl","children":"4. When we share information"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/90","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"We share information only when it is necessary to deliver our services or to meet a legal obligation. Specifically:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"list-disc space-y-2 pl-5","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":["With ","$Lf",", our payment partner, to process pa